window.products.push({"id":657027,"name":"Hyoola Tall Taper Candles - 10 Inch - Metallic Titan - Dripless - 12 Pack - 8 Hour Burn Time","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P5rWAfsIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY CANDLES Need some natural candlelight to illuminate your surroundings for a special occasion? Look no further than these tall taper candles by Hyoola. They exude a warm glow and a long-lasting flame. PRODUCT FEATURES: - Gold Candlesticks - 100% Paraffin Wax Candles - 100% Lead-free Cotton Wicks - Individually Wrapped - Painted Smooth Finish - Dripless - Unscented - Made in Europe SIZE: 10-inch long and have a 3/4-inch base diameter.  PACK: 12-pack.  COLOR: Titan.  BURN TIME: 8-hour burn time.  FITS: Standard candle holders.  WICK: Smokeless, 100% cotton lead-free wicks. MULTIPURPOSE USE Hyoola’s 12-piece candle boxes equip you for any occasion, whether it be a wedding or celebration, religious observance, and more. Illuminate the aisle which the bride and groom walk down to their wedding canopy with a natural, powerful brightness. Place a candle on each restaurant table to create a pleasant ambiance that will make customers wish to return. The clean color of these candles, in combination with their elegant tapered shape, makes them perfect for church prayers, Sabbath kindling lights, and other religious rituals as well. Why Are My Taper Candles Dripping? - The candle might not be completely vertical. If your candle isn't sitting straight, it will burn unevenly, which can lead to wax running too far down the candle before it hardens.  - There could be a draft, air conditioning, fans, outdoors, window draft as well, as a slight breeze which can also cause the candle to burn unevenly and lead to excess wax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P5rWAfsIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B08BNQKGTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BNQKGTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BNQKGTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
