window.products.push({"id":657051,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Powerful Stick Vacuum 6-in-1, Battery Vacuum Cleaner Rechargeable with 2200m-Ah Up to 45 Mins Runtime, Lightweight Handh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kAFVioM1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Powerful Suction, Quickly Cleaning] This INSE cordless vacuum cleaner N6 features high-efficient motor which can produce strong suction and has a good cleaning performance. The vacuum cleaner has adjustable 2 suction power modes. Standard mode is good for dust, pet hair, sesame, etc and with the max mode it can quickly pick up grain, cat litter, from the floor, carpet, sofa, desk, curtain, car, and so on. This sitck vacuum can meet your daily cleaning needs and is perfect for a home with pets. [Long-lasting Life & Fast Charging] The 2200m-Ah battery inside the cordless battery vacuum offers a long-lasting cleaning runtime of 45 minutes in standard mode and 25 minutes in maximum mode. If needed, you can switch between these two modes with the button on the handle. What's more, this rechargeable vacuum cleaner takes only 3-4 hours to fully charge. It can clean the whole house in one charge, which is very convenient for daily and anytime quick cleaning. [5-Stage Advanced Filtration System] Equipped with 5 high-efficient stages of a complete sealing filtration system, the vacuum cleaner cordless can trap 99.99% of microscopic particles and expel cleaner air. The househeld vacuum cleaner filters the air while cleaning to take full care of your home's cleanliness. (Please Note: The stainless filter is washable and the HEPA filter is not washable. And regular cleaning of the stainless filter will prevent weakening of suction and clogging.) [Super Lightweight & Versatile] This lightweight vacuum is only 3.3lbs, very suitable for one-hand cleaning, and very good for the elderly and children to use. Plus, it has a telescoping wand that can convert to a handheld vacuum for cleaning the sofa, curtain, and even the car. What's more, it has a very flexible brush head with a LED light on it. Simply turn it on and an angled beam of light shines directly in front of the vacuum, lighting and capturing tiny bits of dust. [3 Charging Methods & Easy Storage] Comes with a wall mount, this cordless vaccum pet hair can be simply hung on the wall when finishing the cleaning. This battery vacuum cleaner has totally 3 ways to charge, removing the main body to charge, removing the handle to charge, and hanging it on the wall to charge. Easily hidden away in a cupboard, it takes up less room, very convenient to store or use. [What You Will Get] INSE vacuum cordless N6, motorized brush head, retractable metal tube, stiff roller brush, soft roller brush, long crevice, oval brush for fabric surface, 2 replaceable HEPA filters, charging base with mains charger, 2 in 1 cleaner tool for cleaning hair from the roller and HEPA filter, instruction manual, service card and 7/24 INSE customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kAFVioM1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0C2BWRDR1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2BWRDR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2BWRDR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
