window.products.push({"id":657088,"name":"CAROMIO 100% Cotton Jacquard Duvet Cover Queen Size, 3PCS Boho Geometric Chenille Clipped Jacquard Farmhouse Duvet Cover Set for All Season, Grey, 88x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810+dkQFM+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Pre-Washed Cotton: Crafted from 100% cotton face and reverse, this cotton duvet set creates a crisp, natural and cozy sleeping environment for you and your family. The pre-washed process ensures excellent softness, and fabric will actually get softer with repeated washing and stay cozy for years. Unique Chenille Clipped Texture: Adorned with a geometric pattern with clipped chenille trim that provides a lovely textural appeal to the top of your bed, this jacquard duvet cover introduces a soft texture and eye-catching dimension to your bedroom decor. The entire collection has an incredibly soft and cozy design that pairs easily with any decor scheme. Hidden Button Closure and Secure Corner Ties: Delicate and durable hidden button closure at the foot of the duvet cover allows you to place a padded insert (NOT included) within the duvet cover. And four internal corner ties help to prevent it from shifting. Easy to Care: Machine washable separately in cold water, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Iron on lowest setting as needed. Do not dry clean. Due to the nature of the chenille fabric, some shedding will occur naturally in the first 3-4 washes What You Will Get: 3pcs queen size Clipped Chenille Duvet Cover set. 1 x duvet cover: 88 Inches (W) x 92 Inches (L), 2 x pillowcase 20 Inches (W) x 26 Inches (L). Insert NOT Included. Great gift idea for Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810+dkQFM+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAROMIO","source_asin":"B09GLVJ4J6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GLVJ4J6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GLVJ4J6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
