window.products.push({"id":657165,"name":"Metal Serving Tray with Handles - Oval Small and Large Galvanized Tray Set of 2, Elegant Gray Farmhouse Tray Decor for Dining Table, Coffee Table Cent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d95mlpczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our premium galvanized tray decor set will add a superb shabby chic touch to any home. These practical yet stylish accent tray sets are a great way to keep your home well-organized and add a rustic, distressed farmhouse chic touch. The whitewash galvanized metal finish creates an antique Parisian feel, and unlike basic rectangular serving trays, each vintage decor tray features a gorgeous oval shape..Some amazing features of our Oval tray sets:-Top-quality galvanized metal serving tray set x2;-Embossed damask edges;-Cute and practical jute rope handles;-4 anti-scratch stickers that prevent scratches; -Material: durable galvanized zinc-Color: gray with whitewash finish.Some uses for this versatile galvanized metal tray set:-Jewelry or toiletry tray centerpieces;-small succulent plant and candle trays;-decorative trays for ottomans /coffee table tray round accent pieces;-Coffee bar tray /bar trays for liquor display /vintage drink tray;-metal centerpieces for dining table /Farmhouse table centerpieces /Outdoor table decor;-Food and drink tray / trays for dessert table / Farmhouse serving tray/ metal breakfast trayUse the circular silver tray set for weddings, receptions, parties or just at home. These galvanized serving pieces will look beautiful in any bedroom, kitchen, living room, bathroom, office desk, or cafe, and are a thoughtful gift for your mom, sister, girlfriend, aunt, friends and family, which is sure to put a smile on their face .The galvanized rustic serving tray set includes:1 x Large Tray (16.5 x 10.6 x 1.8 inch); 1 x Small Tray (13.4 x 7.1 x 1.8 inch)..Designed in the UK, with beauty, elegance and luxury in mind, there’s no room for compromise. If for some reason you’re not entirely pleased with your purchase, we’ve got you covered with a 30-day money back guarantee! Order your metal rustic tray set now, and make someone's day!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d95mlpczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purple Lily Décor","source_asin":"B08FM6N14P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FM6N14P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FM6N14P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
