window.products.push({"id":657173,"name":"ZENG JIA DAO Meat Cleaver Butcher Knife Heavy Duty Bone Chopper Axe for Kitchen 6 '' Bones Cutting Knife Forged Stainless Steel Solid Pear Wood Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kh9Ckk8jL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","description":"🛒【7 MM Super Thick Blade Heavy Duty Meat Cleaver】1⃣With satisfying heft, premium materials. 2⃣Featuring a beautiful, ergonomic and ambidextrous pear wood handle ensuring a powerful grip. 3⃣Full tang structure for superb robustness and triple riveted for even more resilience. 4⃣The precisely tapered blade minimizes surface resistance for buttery smooth cut through and enhanced non-stick properties. It's especially good at cutting large chunks of meat, tough bones. ⚜【Award Winning Design of Bone Axe】 The axe-style butcher knife has a heavy blade and a slightly longer handle. 🔪The heavy blade design to allow to have enough power to chop hard food, but we still retain good maneuverability. 📐Our bone knife with slightly longer handle uses the principle of leverage, which can generate maximum pressure while saving your wrist power. 🔪The blade of this meat knife is heavy and thick enough, designed to cut hard bones, not suitable for finer work. 💎【Superior Quality Steel Material】The ZENG JIA DAO bone cleaver comes with a 7cr18mov core material with a rock well hardness of around 55+ is very sturdy and can handle a lot of beating without cracking or breaking. Chopping big bones is not easy to damage the blade. It is a core material with ultra-high strength and excellent corrosion resistance. The knife is sharpened at a 17-degree angle. Minimal cutting resistance. Easily re-sharpens, easy to clean and maintain. 👨‍🏭【Handmade Forged Technology】 The bones cutting knife are forged by hand. In order to manufacture superior knives, we have up to 40 procedures and a unique special cold forging process. The processed knives can not only keep the blade particularly sharp, but also have strong corrosion resistance, hot forging process greatly improves the durability and toughness.👍 Compared with kitchen knives made with mechanical ways, the service life of such heavy duty axe knives is longer. ✋【100% Satisfaction Money Back Guarantee】We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier. so we provide 2 months unconditional return,and 1-year warranty. Please feel free to contact us with any questions. With the luxury packing it is also the wise choice as a gift for culinary students, home cooks, professional chefs and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kh9Ckk8jL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZENG JIA DAO","source_asin":"B0BVBCMJK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVBCMJK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVBCMJK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
