window.products.push({"id":657203,"name":"Mosonnytee Buddha Statue Buddha Decor Laughing Buddha Statue for Home Decor Buddhist Decor Gold Buddha Statues for Home Decor (Copper)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G1InYZCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STORY OF laughing buddha】According to legend, the cloth bag monk who was reincarnated by laughing buddha often carried a large cloth bag for alms, and laughing buddha didn't mind what others would give him. Even if someone put something bad, laughing buddha smiled and accepted what people gave him. The reason laughing buddha did this is to bring joy to all living beings. This is the compassionate heart of the laughing buddha. 【High Quality】The laughing buddha made of resin has natural lines and beautiful luster, and is light and strong. It takes half a month to make a laughing buddha. From making molds to painting, every step needs to be made by hand. The combination of black and gold makes the Buddha statue more modern and more beautiful. 【SIZE & WEIGHT】This piece of laughing buddha sits 4.5”tall and 2.7” Wide.Moderate size can be well put into home decor and office decor, and laughing buddha can be well integrated into different styles.Placing laughing buddha at home can bless family peace and bring good luck and wealth. This laughing buddha is not only a positive spiritual power, but also creates a good meditation environment. 【BEAUTIFUL BLESSING FROM laughing buddha】laughing buddha can be used not only for decoration in temples and homes or business, but also for holiday gifts, moving and other occasions, and can entrust your good wishes and expectations. 【PACKAGING SAFETY】We wrap the laughing buddha in a bag and put it in a soft foam box to ensure that the paint and laughing buddha are in good condition during transportation.If there is any damage or paint peeling after receiving the laughing buddha, please contact us to deal with it, and we will serve you wholeheartedly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G1InYZCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mosonnytee","source_asin":"B08SJP4ZSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJP4ZSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJP4ZSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":657204,"name":"77-Cavity Chocolate Mold Ice Cube Candy Mold,Square Silicone Mold for Gummy, Caramel,Jello,Ice Cubes,Cross Grid Candy Making Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H0idyev2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍪Package includes 1 pack silicone mold. SIZE: Each of the 77 square cavities is 1.2\"x1.2\" with a height of 0.78\",AND The entire mold measures 10.6 inches x 16 inches 🍫Material:High quality food-grade safe silicone,temperature resistant for use in the freezer as well as the oven.More textured than other silicone molds of the same type Just what you are looking for! 🍰Characteristic:Durable,non-stick and easy-to-clean,won't crack, break or lose shape made for easy pop-out 🍫Cross Pattern:The cross pattern inside the cavity adds interest and loveliness in candy making. You can slice chocolate/candy into small pieces according to the cross lines 🍫Usage:A large quantity of cavities can help you prepare chocolate,hard candy,ice cubes, jelly,gummy,praline,caramel and other easy-to-create perfect sweet treats","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H0idyev2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NFAMRZCAR","source_asin":"B0BHN72TZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHN72TZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHN72TZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
