window.products.push({"id":657217,"name":"GENSTEUO Blue Star Wall Basket Decor, Set of 3 Woven Basket Wall Decor, 13'' to 9'' Boho Wall Baskets, Hanging Wicker Basket for Living Room or Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TWPFflsfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Value Package] - Contains three bohemian woven wall baskets(13.4 inch, 11inch and 9 inch), using 100% Natural Seagrass, made by the sophisticated hands of the most talented artisans in Northern Vietnam. The wicker basket wall decor is the Newest Trends for Boho Wall Decorations, which will bring a unique visual treat. [Unconventional & Unique Wall Decor] - This 3-piece set of African baskets come in a fresh color palette and breezy bohemian style pattern. Group these pieces together to create a natural and stylish look! Perfect addition for the patio, balcony, living room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room. [Multiple Uses]- In addition to combine them with other baskets or works of art to create a unique basket gallery wall, these flat hanging wall baskets can also be displayed as a center piece, or used as decorative plates to keep your clutter in place - keys, fruits, bread, jewelries, etc. [A Thoughtful (EASY!) GIFT] - Each Boho Wall Baskets Set is Packaged with Care and an Artistic Eye, with its Beautiful and High-Quality Packaging, it not only makes the Gift Ready to Give, but also Protect your baskets from any possible Damage in Transit. Perfect for occasions like Birthday, Mother’s Day, Housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas and others! [Durable And Easy To Clean] - Our woven wall decor are made with dried natural seagrass which is strong and durable for long time use. Simply use a damp cloth to wipe the surface softly. Also, do not submerge or wash these directly with even a bit of hot water. Due to the handcrafted nature of the item, appearance and color may vary slightly, but you'll love them anyway! [Satisfaction Guarantee] - We are confident these decorative wall baskets would bring incredible artisan craftsmanship into your spaces, but if for any reason you are not satisfied we are on hand to help and please feel free to contact us for any concerns you may have.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TWPFflsfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GENSTEUO","source_asin":"B0989W7RBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989W7RBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989W7RBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":657218,"name":"DOUDING Toothbrush Holder, Toothpaste Dispenser + 6 Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted with Sticker for Women Kids Baby Bathroom (Connect Power Supply)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l8Z8npWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DOUDING Wall-Mounted Multifunctional Toothbrush Holder This toothbrush holder include 1 automatic toothpaste dispenser and 6 toothbrush slots. Toothpaste squeezer uses vacuum technology pulls out the last drop of toothpaste to avoid wasting toothpaste. Very Important: Always make sure the toothpaste is tightly screwed into the toothpaste squeezer inlet. Only it's seal connected, it will work very well Installation Steps - Wash the wall - Rip off the protective film - Install to the wall and vent the air - Install the toothbrush holder onto the sticker - Install toothpaste into the toothbrush hole - Squeeze toothpaste by manual to vent air - Place toothbrushes - Please push 3-5 times for the first time using Installation Notes Applicable wall: smooth tile, wooden wall, smooth marble, smooth glass, frosted glass, smooth metal. Not applicable wall: wallpaper, lime wall, paint wall. Please wash the wall before installing. Peel the protective film behind the non-marking sticker and install it to the wall Please use it after 24 hours of installation Toothbrush holder saving bathroom space and making rational use of free space. Designed for your convenient and healthy. Toothbrush Holder Kit Material: High quality ABS, PS and PP Specification Product size: 7.87 x 3.15 x 1.97 inches Product weight: 1.0 lb Package include: 1 x Multifunctional toothbrush holder 1 x Product manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l8Z8npWnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOUDING","source_asin":"B07ZGZRH14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZGZRH14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZGZRH14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
