window.products.push({"id":657267,"name":"XYZ 3 Family Set Personalized Christmas Ornament 2020 for Quarantine Celebrations, Customized Decorative Hanging Ornaments for Home and Tree Decoratio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41676RnA++L._AC_.jpg","description":"Want to add a little sparkling joy this year amidst the difficult time that the world is facing this year? Then you are in need of the bundle of little personalized ornaments joy to not only lit up your house this Christmas but also your mood. These little decorative ornaments will bring a smile to your face and help you to rejoice in the special family moments you got to live this year. Our family Christmas ornaments set is the perfect deal, made up of the best quality resin that does not give any bad smell and is carefully hand-painted by the experienced craftsman to enhance the joy of your family in this Christmas celebrations. It is made from love and compassion to bring out the best joy in your life. It comes with a ribbon loop for easy hanging on the door and your Christmas tree. This customized ornament gives you the choice to write your name or text on it and make your Christmas celebrations more unique and fun by having a personalized ornament to enhance the decoration of the Christmas tree. Its simple yet festive design will remind you of the hard time you have passed this year but it also gives a happy vibe about the future. It is not only a fun ornament for the parents but it is also an amazing yet crafty DIY gift for your kids. Our ornament will let them explore their imagination and to make this ornament personalized with their names, wishes, or text as they want. It is the best way to keep the kids busy in the Christmas holidays. Its bright colors and unique 2020 Santa design will surely turn many heads to your Christmas tree. It comes in different family sets so you can choose what suits you best from our collection. Giving Presents is the main essence of Christmas to thank our loved ones and to appreciate their presence. It's Christmas and you want to give the best, cute and considerate gifts but you cannot go out because of this ongoing Pandemic then our 2020 quarantine Christmas","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41676RnA++L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XYZ","source_asin":"B08L9RG3Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L9RG3Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L9RG3Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
