window.products.push({"id":657310,"name":"1 Gallon Cold Brew Coffee Maker - 3rd Generation Fine Mesh Filter - Stainless Steel Spigot - Extra Thick Large Glass Mason Jar Drink Dispenser Carafe,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wUD50lrwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BREWING MADE EASY: Brewing coffee or tea has never been easier. Perfect for delicious cold brew. The stainless steel weaved mesh filter can fit a large amount of coffee grounds, loose leaf or small tea bags, making it faster to brew in hours. Keeping your home brews fresh for up to weeks. The ability to get cold brewed coffee overnight will save you time and money. Includes 1 of our amazing can shaped glasses iced coffee cup to complete your drinking experience. PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL HEAVY DUTY WEAVED MESH QUALITY: While other brands use a 100 or 150 micron mesh. Le'raze uses a 50 Micron mesh weave coffee filter that is far superior in terms of strength and durability. The 50 Micron tightly woven weave keeps out super fine sediment and sludge compared to the competitor’s while maintaining nutrients and fresh taste. Plus It's Dishwasher Safe. Simply adding up to 400 grams (5 1/2 cups) of coarse coffee grounds in this pour over coffee maker, room temperature water and letting it steep overnight. EXTRA THICK GLASS CARAFE & AIRTIGHT LID: Crafted with extra thick glass, designed to brew 1 GALLON of cold brew coffee. The Screw on stainless steel lid is airtight & rust-free which will ensure coffee, tea, or infused water fresh and tasty each time. Keep your home brews fresh for weeks. 100% LEAKPROOF STAINLESS STEEL SPIGOT: The high quality stainless steel adjustable spout gives you comfortable access to pour coffee with no mess in your kitchen refrigerator and control the flow rate by yourself. Our ice coffee maker offers long-lasting service not like other plastic did. A MONEY SAVER: Spending on overpriced cups of coffee can really add up! With this beautiful cold coffee brewer you can make delicious cold brew from the comfort of your own home, helping you save on unnecessary purchases. Elegant and well designed, this cold brew coffee maker is the best investment you can make. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Fits perfectly in any fridge, and is dishwasher safe. Above all we are convinced you will be more than satisfied with your purchase and therefore offer a lifetime warranty*.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wUD50lrwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le'raze","source_asin":"B09WXWP3H1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WXWP3H1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WXWP3H1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
