window.products.push({"id":657360,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies Dream a Child is Born Nativity Figurines, 6.25 inch (Set of 5)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BjfHtK77L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"For over 27 years Department 56 artist, Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter. Her personal experiences and interpretations of childhood are artfully designed into each Snowbabies' piece and carefully named to ensure a sentiment of love, friendship or inspiration. The new SnowDream collection is inspired by a winter walk in the woods with icy colors of white, pink, grey and cool taupe. Each piece is sprinkled with glitter creating a magical effect. \"As an artist my job is to invent. After a year of sketching and conceptualizing I created this new collection. It's a nostalgic collection of figural giftware and trim full of warmth, whimsy and magic. It combines the simple elegance of bisque porcelain with glitter, shiny mica and tinsel. I love the results and I hope that collectors will, too!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BjfHtK77L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AXRVQFI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXRVQFI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXRVQFI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":657361,"name":"Showgeous Wedding Arch Draping Fabric 4 Panels 20Ft Champagne Chiffon Fabric Sheer Backdrop Curtain for Wedding Ceremony Arch Stage Party Ceiling Swag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-gBruPk+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️【Product Included】: 4 panels of wedding arch draping fabric. Each panel is 30 inches wide and 20 feet long. The length is long enough to fit any size arch decoration, soft and overhanging pendants make the wedding decorations more popular. ❤️【High-quality Materials】: The champagne wedding arch drape fabric is made of polyester material. These drapery fabric panels are made of a unique fabric that has a sightly shimmer, they are silky soft and more graceful than tulle or nylon fabrics. Lightweight, soft, wrinkle-free, vertical and easy to care for. ❤️【Perfect Design】: This arched curtain makes your party more romantic. We are giving away a free roll of ribbon that you can use to tie your arched curtains, hang some balloon garlands, happy birthday banners, pennants, glitter star garlands, curtain lights, artificial flowers with stems to add an elegant and romantic vibe. This backdrop is perfect for creating beautiful pleats or letting it float off the floor, adding a very delicate, soft, beautiful touch to your stage at any event. ❤️【Widely Use】: Beautiful wedding arch decorations are perfect for wedding arches, party backdrops, photo backdrops, party stages, Valentine's Day, and even home interiors, adding a touch of purity. Champagne wedding arch drape fabric can also be used on a canopy, chuppah, arbor or altar. Soft and smooth, our arched curtains are the ideal and efficient decorating style for the modern home. Sheer arched curtains will help create an eye-catching detail in your wedding decor. ❤️【Easy to clean】: You can wipe the surface with a damp cloth. It is best to gently hand or machine wash in a laundry bag. Do not bleach, lay flat or hang to dry. With a steam iron, wrinkles disappear and can be used repeatedly. ❤️【Our Service】: Our product quality is guaranteed. If you encounter any problems during purchase or use, you can consult our 24-hour online service. We will also be responsible for the unfortunate orders with small probability and give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-gBruPk+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Showgeous","source_asin":"B0BCWQQ55D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCWQQ55D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCWQQ55D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
