window.products.push({"id":657403,"name":"3 Piece Bath Towels - Bath Towel Set - Cotton Bath Towels - Best Bath Towels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917bUXPtrXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 piece bath towels set: This set of striped bath towels makes a colorful addition to your bathroom. Perfect for lovers of contemporary, retro and fun designs. Each set features assorted stripes and no two sets are the same. At 27 x 54 inches each, the towels are a substantial size to use as bath towels or guest towels. Durable enough for everyday use. Machine washable and easy to keep clean Soft bath towels: Made from quality 100% ring spun cotton that is soft and fluffy against the skin and gets softer with each use. Features reinforced side hems to prevent fraying. Absorbent: These luxury bath towels are made from 100% cotton which is naturally absorbent. GSM stands for grams per square meter and is used to measure the density and thickness of the towels. Lower quality towels have a thickness of around 300 GSM. This towel set is a medium weight quality at 600 GSM. This ensures the towels are thick and soft enough but also lightweight for quick drying. We do not compromise on quality. Oeko Tex bath towels: Our towels are Oeko Tex certified, skin safe and family friendly. They have been independently tested and are free of harmful chemicals or dyes that could be absorbed through the skin. Excellent value: This convenient set includes 3 generously sized bath towels. It offers excellent value for money and is a cheaper alternative to buying towels individually. This towel set also makes a great gift for families, newlyweds or housewarming parties","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917bUXPtrXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Linen","source_asin":"B0852KZ5G6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0852KZ5G6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0852KZ5G6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":657404,"name":"Green Valley Decorative Designer Acrylic Serving Tray with Handles 10\" x 15.75\" Kids Party Countertop Vanity Table Tray for Coffee Table TV Room Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ya+ltMMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our decorative acrylic trays offer a unique and transparent way to serve up some style. Use them to give your next dinner party a little something extra or for a pop of color as a kitchen accent.Specifications : Size: 10\" x 15.75\" x 2\" 3D printed artwork featured on bottom panel Tray has hand holes for easy carrying Includes feet to avoid scratching surfaces Clean using a moist non-abrasive cloth and wipe dry How to Care for Acrylic Tray Now that your acrylic tray is crystal-clear and sparkling, you'll want to make sure they stay that way. Here is the tips on how to keep acrylic tray decor in tip-top shape. 1. Beware of ammonia Acrylic's number one enemy is ammonia. So when it comes to cleaning Lucite and acrylic pieces, \"don't use any cleaner that has ammonia—ever!\" says Von Furstenberg. The ingredient causes acrylic and Lucite to become cloudy, something you won't be able to reverse. 2. Be gentle Acrylic can scratch easily, so avoid contact with sharp or abrasive items. If you want to place a metal or similarly hard-edged object on top of an acrylic table or tray, Von Furstenberg suggests adhering felt pads to the underside of the piece to prevent it from scraping against the delicate surface. \"Treat it similarly to a lacquered table—don’t drag anything across it; rather, lift up the item and then put it down.\" 3. Cover up When storing your acrylic accessories, treat them as carefully as you would any piece of high-quality furniture. \"Cover the object in a sheet or soft fabric and place it in a shaded and climate-controlled area,\" says Von Furstenberg. This way, the item will be good as new when you reach for it again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ya+ltMMzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09HPZQR3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HPZQR3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HPZQR3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
