window.products.push({"id":657501,"name":"Silicone Lid Cover and Sealing Ring for Instant Pot 8 Quart models – Perfect Fitting Lid cover and ring for IP-LUX 80, IP-DUO 80, Duo Plus 80, Ultra 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615333JqbZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"BEST VALUE = HIGH QUALITY + ECONOMICAL PRICE - This combo pack includes one silicone lid and one sealing ring. They are made of high quality food-grade silicone which is wear, corrosion and high temperature resistance. BPA-free and dishwasher safe. It is safe for the health of your families and also no harm to the environment. Compared with buying them separately, this set is not only high quality material guaranteed, but also saving you money. SILICONE LID WITH EXCELLENT AIRTIGHT AND SPLASH-PROOF - This silicone cover creates an airtight and watertight seal on the instant pot stainless steel inner pot. It provides a secure and tight grip around the edges of the instant pot inner lid to avoid accidentally splashing out or leakage and keep your kitchen clean. It is also perfect for storing and reheating leftovers while maintains food freshness and tasty. PERFECT DESIGNED SEALING RING WITH LEAK PROOF - A sealing ring is a crucial piece of the instant pot because it ensures optimal pressure cooking. This replacement sealing ring fits snugly and tight around the instant pot lid, makes sure that no more pressure leaking out around the edges of the instant pot. It is engineered for strength and durability, easy to install and remove. COMPATIBLE WITH INSTANT POT 8 QT MODELS - This accessory set is perfect for Instant Pot Duo 8 Quart, Lux 8 Quart, Duo Plus 8 Quart, Ultra 8 Quart, Viva 8 Quart. The sealing ring is porous and may absorb odors and become discolored. To avoid discoloration and odors, it is recommended to replace the instant pot sealing ring every 12-18 months. A MUST HAVE ACCESSORY SET FOR INSTANT POT - This set of accessories solves the sealing and storage problems you may have. It allows you to maximize the role of the high pressure cooker without worry about leakage or splashing. They come in 2 colors to meet your wide range of applications. Let us enjoy cooking with this wonderful Instant Pot accessory set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615333JqbZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STYDDI","source_asin":"B07CPP1CZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CPP1CZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CPP1CZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":657502,"name":"CHUN YI 5 Piece Loveseat Sofa Cover, 2 Seater Stretch Couch Slipcover with Two Separate Backrest and Cushion with Elastic Band, Houndstooth Fabric( Sm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CW6YpHR7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"85% Polyester Fiber and 15% Spandex Fabric PRODUCT UPGRADE: Many customers purchase sofa covers, backrest covers, and cushion covers in batches, but found colors not the same after installation. In order to solve this problem and make our products more cost-effective, we upgraded our products and sold these three sofa covers together to new and old users. WE HAVE APPLIED FOR A PATENT FOR THE APPEARANCE DESIGN AND BUTTON DESIGN OF THE PRODUCT. PREMIUM FABRIC: Spandex blend fabric with classical houndstooth pattern and made by premium jacquard knitting machine and exquisite workmanship. The premium fabric makes our slipcover super soft and comfortable while sturdy and durable.Adopts the latest textile dyeing process, enhance the luxury feeling of the living room. MEASURE SIZE: The Small size sofa is suitable for sofa length between 32\"-47\". The medium size sofa is 57\"-70\". The large size sofa is 72\"-92\". X-Large size sofa is 92\"-118\". All the cushion size measures up to 20-25 inch length, 20-27.5 inch wide, 2-9 inch thickness. All the backrest size measures 32-40 inch length, 20-28 inch wide, 2-9 inch thickness. For more size information, please check our size chart. We suggest you measure your furniture before purchasing. PERFECT DESIGN: Specially designed for sofas with separate cushions and backrests. Can cover the back of your sofa, offer 360° all aspect coverage to your sofa and cushions. Suitable for a variety of sofa types, such as T cushion sofas, fabric sofa, leather sofa, etc. Both the main sofa cover and the cushion covers are equipped with elastic bands at the bottom, which can firmly wrap your sofa in place and will not cause slipping or wrinkles. EASY TO INSTALL AND MAINTAIN: Easy to install, our sofa covers and cushion covers have elastic bands, and the backrest covers have buckles and drawstrings, you could check our attached video for more detailed installation steps. Machine washable. For drying, tumble dry low and remove them promptly from dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CW6YpHR7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHUN YI","source_asin":"B08P3D9VK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P3D9VK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P3D9VK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
