window.products.push({"id":657562,"name":"ASDO Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener, Full - Automatic Hands Free Can Opener, Chef's Best Choice Best Kitchen Gadget for Arthritis(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BxFGrXzIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Embedded blade This automatic can opener is characterized by a sharp blade, which is safely hidden in the device. This safety feature helps prevent accidental finger cuts when searching for tools in the kitchen drawer. Metal gear With the simple design of the automatic can opener, using the can opener couldn't be easier. To open the can, place the edge of the can between the blade and the metal gear. The metal gear guides the edge of the can through the can opener, causing it to move on the entire 360 Degree circumference. Battery compartment The new can opener is completely different from the original design in appearance. In addition, it is designed with a plastic sheet in the battery box to further stabilize the installed battery. On/off switch Simple one-button operation couldn't be easier. Just press to start cutting cans, and then press again to stop the operation at any time. 2Insert the 2AA battery into the right pole (battery not included) The battery slots are marked with positive and negative signs. When installing four dry batteries, the user should operate according to the signs. After installation, close the battery cover and you can use the product. How do I open the battery compartment? Recently, we learned that the battery cover is difficult to open when customers install batteries. Please follow the steps below to easily install the battery. Step 1: Find the non-slip edge of the can opener. Step 2: Press down on the non-slip edge on the left, and then gently push back. Step 3: Same operation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BxFGrXzIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASDO","source_asin":"B08RJ1463N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RJ1463N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RJ1463N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
