window.products.push({"id":657857,"name":"Nicebay Electric Gooseneck Kettle, Electric Kettle with Heating Base with Buttons and LED Display, Pure Stainless Steel Inner Electric Tea Kettle, 120","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RIlUUn+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Gooseneck Design & Precise Pouring】The unique gooseneck spout design of the electric kettle makes the kettle have a slow and steady flow of water when pouring. The sharp spout design enables precise pouring when brewing coffee or tea and is not easy to spill. The designed handle can stabilize the body of the pot when pouring water and prevent spills. 【Heated Base with Buttons and LED Display】The heated base of the gooseneck coffee kettle has a temp setting knob and three buttons——start/cancel, keep warm and Fahrenheit/Celsius convert. The Fahrenheit/Celsius convert button also acts as a MUTE button. (NOTE: ALL PROGRAMS WILL BE MUTED AFTER ENTERING SILENT MODE.) The temp setting knob can precisely adjust the required heating temperature. The LED display panel can show the real temp when heating and keep warm. 【High Quality Stainless Steel Material】The coffee pot is made of pure high-quality food-grade 304 stainless steel, including the lid, spout and the interior of the pot. High-quality materials, BPA-free, no other harmful chemicals, absolutely guarantee the safety of drinking. 【1200W Fast Heating】The high power of 1200W makes the gooseneck kettle heat up quickly, and it only takes 3 to 5 minutes to boil a pot of 0.8L water. Greatly reduces the waiting time for brewing coffee or tea. After heating, you can set a desired temperature and press the keep warm button to keep warm. So you can get warm water to brew coffee or tea at any time. 【Auto Shut Off & Boil-Dry Protection】The gooseneck electric kettle with Strix Thermostat Technology has an automatic shut-off function. When the water temperature reaches the set temperature, the kettle will automatically turn off. And the electric kettle will stop working to prevent dry burning when there is no water in the kettle. We provide 24 hours online service, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us and we will definitely give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RIlUUn+NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nicebay","source_asin":"B0BQN5XRHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657857","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQN5XRHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQN5XRHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
