window.products.push({"id":657937,"name":"SILVER ONE Cozy Wearable Fleece Throw Blanket with Pocket, Comfy Robe for Men or Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5119bXW0bsL._AC_SL1131_.jpg","description":"PLUSH LOUNGEWEAR: What’s better than a blanket you can wear around? Slip it on over the front of your body, sprawl out on the couch, and enjoy the full-body coverage of this warm wearable blanket in your downtime. Stay toasty all day long in its ultra-soft velvet and experience the ultimate softness and lightweight comfort. Perfect for snuggles with your pets, kids, or significant other. A GREAT GIFT FOR ANYONE: When Christmas/Mother's Day and other holidays roll around, consider these oversize unisex blankets as a gift for a friend or loved one. Any man or woman, especially sleepwear enthusiasts, will love its thick, snuggly embrace at the end of a long day. Unlike many gift alternatives, you will be able to use this wearable blanket daily all year long. BUILT-IN FRONT POCKET: It’s all too easy to lose remote controls, cell phones, food, and more in your blanket while you’re relaxing in bed or on the couch. Just like your favorite pants, these blankets feature large sewn-on pockets that can accommodate a number of loose items and keep them in one place where you can easily find them. INNOVATIVE SLEEVE DESIGN: It’s the issue as old as time that you’ve faced at one point or another; you’re trying to keep your upper body all wrapped up in your blanket but you still need your arms free to control the remote or type on your laptop. This blanket is designed with sleeves to give you the freedom you need to use your hands while reading or eating a snack while watching TV. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Unlike your average bathrobe, this giant fuzzy blanket robe measures 60” x 78”, making it perfect for anybody from young children to adults. It’s made from 250 GSM of luxury microfiber polyester, an easy-to-care-for material. Instead of putting on a sweatshirt on a cold day, curl up with this comfortable throw blanket and get warm from head to toe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5119bXW0bsL._AC_SL1131_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SILVER ONE","source_asin":"B07CZQC6K9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZQC6K9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZQC6K9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":657938,"name":"VVA Cow Print Black Fabric Shower Curtain Cowhide Pattern with Plain Black Spots Barnyard Cattle Style Cloth Decor Set with Hooks for Bathroom 72”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7147T4DM17L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EXPRESS YOUR PERSONALITY】The exceptional colors and designs on each shower curtain accentuate your style and personality in a whole new way. You will be able to find the one that matches your personality and OWN the design of your bathroom. Enjoy showering in a beautiful surrounding of your choice! 【PREMIUM QUALITY & WATERPROOF】This 72x72 inch elegant bathroom shower curtain is made of 100% Polyester fabric which is treated to make water bead on the surface, quick repel and dry. This is a waterproof shower curtain, so you can use it without a curtain liner. Provides privacy and decoration for your bathroom, and sturdy design prevents it from fluttering and splashing water on your floor. 【DRAPES NICELY & WEIGHTED HEM】Our shower curtain drapes nicely and extends down naturally. Weighted hem at bottom provides weight and stability to make sure the shower curtain stays in place and does not stick to your legs. This shower curtain also has a reinforced TOP hem, which makes sure the curtain never falls when you are in the shower. 【METAL GROMMETS & FREE HOOKS】This fabric shower curtain is fitted with rustproof metal grommets on the top hem, which prevents it from ripping or tearing. Includes 12 metal hooks with silver bead rings, which are easy and convenient to install in your bathroom or use at your home, apartment, condo, hotel, camper, RV, dorm, school shower, athletic club, gym and everywhere else you need a reliable shower curtain. 【CARE INSTRUCTIONS】For your convenience, this shower curtain is safe to machine wash with cold water. Machine wash in a gentle cycle; tumble it on low heat. Do not bleach or expose the shower curtain to the sun for a long time. Shrink resistant, easy to clean and maintain. It can be cleaned with a quick rinse or wipe down after a shower. The color will stay nice and vibrant for years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7147T4DM17L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VVA","source_asin":"B07Z8NTMBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-657938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z8NTMBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z8NTMBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
